{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"accusations\": [\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Zhang等，2025年，PMC-STN alpha coherence与冻结持续时间关联研究（关键词：freezing of gait、turning、cortical-subthalamic alpha coherence）\",\n      \"pmid\": \"41131028\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"报告认为该研究关于PMC-STN alpha coherence与冻结持续时间之间关联方向的描述存在内部不一致，因而将关联方向视为不明确。报告还记录了TurnStart阶段PMC-STN alpha coherence相对于步行基线增加的结果。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原文Figure 4明确报告：TurnPre阶段PMC-STN alpha coherence增加预测较短的冻结持续时间（β=0.205，p=0.006）。原文采用的计算公式为(Walk-Turn)/Walk，计算方向与Figure 4图注结论一致。因此，原文不存在报告所称的关联方向内部不一致，不应将该结果判定为方向不明确。该发现实际上支持H4代偿性重组解释的可能性，但不能据此证明因果关系。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "53fcbc5b-6de7-4f9a-a7be-f618e0f1dba8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T124928256258Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.14, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T12:50:05.402953+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4e109b16dd87efa66f67d30b69e7c3ffab43e5b4a7e825c306ba13c46c57f329", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4